  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n((133)/(7)+(91)/(13)-(216)/(36)) + ((209)/(11)-(96)/(16)+(45)/(5))\n\n**Formula used:**\n\nSimplifying fractions and performing arithmetic operations.\n\n**Calculations:**\n\n(133)/(7) = 19\n\n(91)/(13) = 7\n\n(216)/(36) = 6\n\n⇒ (19 + 7 - 6) = 20\n\n(209)/(11) = 19\n\n(96)/(16) = 6\n\n(45)/(5) = 9\n\n⇒ (19 - 6 + 9) = 22\n\n⇒ (20 + 22) = 42\n\n**∴ The value is 42.**",
